flowchart TD
    Login[Login / AuthLayout] --> API[api.js Basic Auth probe to FastAPI]
    API -->|401| Login
    API -->|success| Shell[App.jsx route composition / AppLayout]
    Shell --> Request[RequestView / AssetRequestForm]
    Shell --> Dashboard[DashboardView: list / search / filter]
    Shell --> Settings[SettingsView: account / developer tools / ZendeskSetupView]
    Request -->|created request| Detail[RequestDetailView]
    Dashboard -->|select row| Detail
    Detail --> State[Local status / Zendesk status / sync state via api.js]
    Settings --> Swagger[FastAPI /docs]
    Settings --> Setup[Governed setup through api.js]
